&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title: &lt;/strong&gt;Pre-Sales Solutions Architect&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;London / Bristol - Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Commercial&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To: &lt;/strong&gt;Head of Client Solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Pre-Sales Solution Architect, you’ll sit at the intersection of technology and commercial strategy, shaping how prospective clients understand, adopt, and succeed with the Kaluza platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with Pre-Sales Consultants, you’ll lead the technical aspects of sales engagements — from running deep-dive sessions on architecture and data models, through solution design, to handing off to implementation teams during the contracting phase. Your primary focus will be designing each client’s “to-be” architecture and defining integration patterns, ensuring solutions meet business requirements while making the best use of Kaluza’s current and planned capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No two engagements are the same. You may support early-stage prototypes, present at client sites, or advise our Product Architecture team on emerging market needs and common integration patterns. This is a varied, high-impact role that will stretch your technical expertise, client management skills, and platform knowledge in equal measure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your key responsibilities will include:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery &amp;amp; Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11ttzmp&quot; data-start=&quot;1586&quot; data-end=&quot;1671&quot;&gt;Lead discovery workshops to understand current and target technical architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1qfz7h2&quot; data-start=&quot;1672&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Translate complex requirements into solution designs that maximise client value and enable successful implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15y1l3g&quot; data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1927&quot;&gt;Develop a deep understanding of each client’s technical landscape and transformation goals to design optimal “to-be” architectures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;x0s8gf&quot; data-start=&quot;1928&quot; data-end=&quot;2002&quot;&gt;Estimate work packages to set implementation programmes up for success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tender &amp;amp; Proposal Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g9mo3i&quot; data-start=&quot;2039&quot; data-end=&quot;2173&quot;&gt;Collaborate with product and technology teams to evolve base solution architectures and deliver compelling technical presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;eibd5l&quot; data-start=&quot;2174&quot; data-end=&quot;2250&quot;&gt;Provide key technical input into tender responses and customer proposals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10yf5zu&quot; data-start=&quot;2251&quot; data-end=&quot;2336&quot;&gt;Partner with Pre-Sales Engineering to shape and design proof-of-concept exercises&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1udgkjl&quot; data-start=&quot;2337&quot; data-end=&quot;2409&quot;&gt;Travel to client sites across the UK, Europe, and beyond as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Advocacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pbz02c&quot; data-start=&quot;2434&quot; data-end=&quot;2558&quot;&gt;Act as a bridge between market demand and Kaluza’s engineering teams, ensuring client needs are reflected in the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mr885f&quot; data-start=&quot;2559&quot; data-end=&quot;2650&quot;&gt;Ensure proposed solutions align with core platform capabilities and strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measurable Outcomes:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12263r8&quot; data-start=&quot;2678&quot; data-end=&quot;2769&quot;&gt;Advise clients on achieving measurable business outcomes through a data-driven approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1hep75n&quot; data-start=&quot;2770&quot; data-end=&quot;2852&quot;&gt;Support commercial conversations by helping quantify the value of the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a technologist with a strong focus on business outcomes who thrives at the intersection of strategy and execution. You’re comfortable running deep technical sessions with architects while also articulating a clear strategic vision to C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bmvvqh&quot; data-start=&quot;3162&quot; data-end=&quot;3270&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3164&quot; data-end=&quot;3195&quot;&gt;Enterprise SaaS Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience delivering complex enterprise software implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p9igwo&quot; data-start=&quot;3271&quot; data-end=&quot;3401&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3273&quot; data-end=&quot;3302&quot;&gt;Exceptional Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Able to distil complex concepts into clear, persuasive messages for a wide range of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rej354&quot; data-start=&quot;3402&quot; data-end=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3404&quot; data-end=&quot;3429&quot;&gt;Technical Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience building and architecting systems, including some of:
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3499&quot; data-end=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1via8wh&quot; data-start=&quot;3499&quot; data-end=&quot;3532&quot;&gt;Architecting solutions on AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;r7o4vg&quot; data-start=&quot;3535&quot; data-end=&quot;3568&quot;&gt;Finance and billing platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;13x97kl&quot; data-start=&quot;3571&quot; data-end=&quot;3620&quot;&gt;API technologies such as GraphQL and webhooks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ajky3r&quot; data-start=&quot;3621&quot; data-end=&quot;3731&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3623&quot; data-end=&quot;3657&quot;&gt;Customer-Centric &amp;amp; Analytical:&lt;/strong&gt; Focused on solving the right problems and using data to measure success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gmdv2l&quot; data-start=&quot;3732&quot; data-end=&quot;3866&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3734&quot; data-end=&quot;3757&quot;&gt;Agile &amp;amp; Autonomous:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable navigating ambiguity in a fast-paced, evolving environment while managing multiple workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;6vdotp&quot; data-start=&quot;3867&quot; data-end=&quot;4011&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3869&quot; data-end=&quot;3892&quot;&gt;Industry Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working within regulated energy retailers, particularly across billing, metering, and settlements systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dt7tf7&quot; data-start=&quot;4012&quot; data-end=&quot;4106&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;4014&quot; data-end=&quot;4033&quot;&gt;Mission-Driven:&lt;/strong&gt; Motivated by the role technology plays in the global energy transition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;kk22gc&quot; data-start=&quot;3732&quot; data-end=&quot;3829&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3734&quot; data-end=&quot;3765&quot;&gt;Enterprise SaaS Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience architecting SaaS solutions in the energy industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;m4zmhp&quot; data-start=&quot;3830&quot; data-end=&quot;3924&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3832&quot; data-end=&quot;3861&quot;&gt;Architectural Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing large-scale, impactful software systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;11w4q23&quot; data-start=&quot;3925&quot; data-end=&quot;4024&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3927&quot; data-end=&quot;3967&quot;&gt;Energy Retail Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience working with or for a large energy retailer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;From us you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible bank holidays, giving you an additional 8 days which you can choose to take whenever you like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive leave policies with no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated personal learning and home office budgets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working — we trust you to work in a way that suits your lifestyle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more…&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Even better? You’ll have access to these benefits from day 1 when you join.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
